{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stickman Puzzle throws you into a wobbly world of physics chaos, where every victory feels like outsmarting the universe and every failure is just an excuse to try something even dumber. Wiggle, fling, and fumble your way in this doodle-drawn adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589540/extras/c735535d38fc996112a357f306930c75.gif?t=1742408287\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Stickman Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stickman Puzzle is a physics-driven adventure where every move feels like a genius plan\u2014until it isn't. Guide your wobbly stickman through hand-drawn levels, using creative (or completely ridiculous) solutions to reach the goal. When things go wrong, just blame gravity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589540/extras/e776f66feb248c10d04ba968f2a63a63.gif?t=1742408287\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its charming doodle art and unpredictable physics, every attempt is a mix of skill, luck, and hilarious chaos. Whether you're carefully plotting your moves or just winging it, the fun is in the struggle. Can you outsmart the laws of physics, or will the stickman\u2019s flailing arms get the best of you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589540?t=1742408287","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589540?t=1742408287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589540/b96c8ffd825b1a5528c965aab5ae279498ef4cfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742408287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589540/b96c8ffd825b1a5528c965aab5ae27